00:10:30.501 --> 00:10:31.968
I'm not looking.

00:10:31.968 --> 00:10:33.167
-I like it.
-Yeah?

00:10:33.167 --> 00:10:34.300
-Yeah.
-Okay. Okay.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.567
-Okay.
-We got this?

00:10:35.567 --> 00:10:36.634
-Yeah. Yeah.
-Okay.

00:10:36.634 --> 00:10:38.267
♪♪

00:10:41.367 --> 00:10:43.167
