-No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:13:10.067 --> 00:13:11.767
Do it again. Do it again.
-One more time. One more time.

00:13:11.767 --> 00:13:12.767
Do it again.

00:13:12.767 --> 00:13:14.334
