00:13:21.067 --> 00:13:23.834
Oh.

00:13:24.367 --> 00:13:26.901
Oh. Oh.

00:13:26.901 --> 00:13:28.334
Oh, wait, wait.

00:13:28.334 --> 00:13:30.300
